# `rules.get`

Raw rule body at the requested scope.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.rules.read`.

## Arguments

| name | type |
|------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `scope` | `string` |

## Returns

`RuleGetResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `id` | `string` |
| `scope` | `string` |
| `body` | `string` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call rules.get --json '{ "id": "", "scope": "" }'
```

Kind: read.

## Example response

```json
{
  "id": "no-placeholders",
  "scope": "project",
  "body": "# No placeholders\n\nNo TODOs, no fake data. If it's not finished, remove it. The next agent treats your scaffold as architecture.\n"
}
```
